  "conclusion": "The old Maxima generated C uses -O2 but its delivered JS glue uses the ASSERTIONS-on constructor form. EMCC_CFLAGS=-Oz also optimizes that final link, whose default ASSERTIONS becomes zero. The admitted old glue constructs Error with strError and symbolic-code lookup on ErrnoError; the admitted candidate uses an errno-only class. About 2.05\u20132.10 seconds of each old instrumented first grade is sampled in that constructor, accounting for most of the first-grade gap. Both profiles still load genut.mac. This is a real first-use/runtime-glue improvement, not a demonstrated tenfold speedup of algebra or warmed grading.",
